  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental prorgam. Phase 2.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving environmental status through three sub-projects: (i) Water management, (ii) conservation of biodiversity and (iii) management of hazardous waste. This includes protection of national parks, forests and wetlands. A component also provides scholarships to Master&apos;s Degree students.</narrative>
  </description>
